{"id":"n74123-6-8","stage":0,"title":"때 · 期间","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74123-6-8-1","ko":"이번 휴가 때 어떻게 할 계획이세요?","zh":"这次假期您有什么打算吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"휴가","meaning":"休假，度假，放假，假期","explanation":"휴가：休假，度假，放假，假期","readings":[{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73251","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴가","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"期间，时候","explanation":"때：期间，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"6","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"어떻게","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떻게","audio":"/audio/64e493d09f1b306ade0c.mp3"}},{"text":"할","meaning":"决定","explanation":"하다：决定；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"16","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할","audio":"/audio/3b4c012b3f82dedb34a0.mp3"}},{"text":"계획이세요?","meaning":"计划，筹划","explanation":"계획：计划，筹划；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"계획","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23324","senseId":"1","lemma":"계획","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"계획이세요","audio":"/audio/0b20910c1b281ac477c9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"9e9f8123891fae1c","term":"휴가","zh":"休假，度假，放假，假期","audio":"/audio/9e9f8123891fae1cf99f.mp3","entryId":"73251","definition":"属于工作单位或军队等团体的人在一定期间内从岗位上脱离出来并休息；或指这种时间。","pronunciation":["휴가"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"期间，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某一时期内。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"决定","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"把某事定下来。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"b0fe4ea3ac5ac402","term":"계획","zh":"计划，筹划","audio":"/audio/b0fe4ea3ac5ac4022d19.mp3","entryId":"23324","definition":"仔细考虑并决定将来的事情。","pronunciation":["계ː획","게ː훽"]}],"audio":"/audio/a75420d91677ab28f263.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n74123-6-8-2","ko":"가족들과 함께 여행을 가려고요.","zh":"我打算和家人一起去旅行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가족들과","meaning":"家庭，家人","explanation":"가족：家庭，家人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；과：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"가족","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44487","senseId":"1","lemma":"가족","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가족들과","audio":"/audio/a3e89ffa2a04e35bba2e.mp3"}},{"text":"함께","meaning":"一起，共同，与共","explanation":"함께：一起，共同，与共","readings":[{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72465","senseId":"1","lemma":"함께","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"함께","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3"}},{"text":"여행을","meaning":"旅行，旅游","explanation":"여행：旅行，旅游；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"여행","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28026","senseId":"1","lemma":"여행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여행을","audio":"/audio/8e4d1a5a7460b5dcfa6a.mp3"}},{"text":"가려고요.","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가려고요","audio":"/audio/043170a05ce101181469.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7659575fd72a872b","term":"가족","zh":"家庭，家人","audio":"/audio/7659575fd72a872b8d05.mp3","entryId":"44487","definition":"主要指聚在一起生活，由婚姻、父母、子女、兄弟等的关系构成的社会单位；或指其成员。","pronunciation":["가족"]},{"id":"6d2b6bbf82785e6d","term":"함께","zh":"一起，共同，与共","audio":"/audio/6d2b6bbf82785e6dce3d.mp3","entryId":"72465","definition":"许多人一下子同时。","pronunciation":["함께"]},{"id":"b5d87b0a7b5d6b82","term":"여행","zh":"旅行，旅游","audio":"/audio/b5d87b0a7b5d6b82f2a8.mp3","entryId":"28026","definition":"离开家，去其他地区或国外游玩的行为。","pronunciation":["여행"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1ea3fc8303fc0ca4410f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.94,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=74123","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"6","sourceLevel":"초급","day":19,"sequenceScore":0.7431,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这次假期您有什么打算吗？","我打算和家人一起去旅行。","金司机，把车停一下。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次假期您有什么打算吗？","我打算和家人一起去旅行。","金司机，把车停一下。"],"answer":1}]}
